OL,3,GNEWSA'Dissident republicans may be
OL,4,Aresponsible' for explosive device at
OL,5,Ahotel - PSNI
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice believe dissident republicans
OL,8,Fmay be responsible for a "viable postal
OL,9,Fdevice" which was delivered to a hotel
OL,10,Fin Londonderry.
OL,12,FAmmunition Technical Officers (ATO)
OL,13,Fwere tasked to the hotel at Ebrington
OL,14,FSquare in the Waterside after the
OL,15,Fpackage was discovered at about 15:20
OL,16,FGMT on Tuesday.
OL,18,FThey carried out a controlled explosion
OL,19,Fon the device, which was later taken
OL,20,Faway for a forensic examination.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
