OL,3,GNEWSA'Dissident republicans may be
OL,4,Aresponsible' for explosive device at
OL,5,Ahotel - PSNI
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice Service of Northern Ireland
OL,8,F(PSNI) Chief Supt Gillian Kearney
OL,9,Fcondemned it as "shameful and utterly
OL,10,Fabhorrent", adding that "those
OL,11,Fresponsible clearly do not care who or
OL,12,Fwhat they harm".
